  <name>Open Source Stacks for Distributed Computing</name>
  <description>
    Build distributed systems with software stacks for high-availability clustering,
    partitioned resource management, distributed transaction handling, data-local compute and more.

    The stacks source code originates from other open source projects and includes 
    modifications by mishmash io. Visit our website and GitHub for more.
  </description>
